<html>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f3f5f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b1f24;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f3f5f8;padding:24px 0;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td style="background-color:#0B5CAB;color:#ffffff;padding:20px 28px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">Smart Car Rental</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:28px;">
<p style="font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</p>
<p style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Great news &ndash; your booking <strong>{!Booking__c.Name}</strong> is confirmed. Here are your trip details:</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="font-size:14px;border-collapse:collapse;">
<tr style="background-color:#f3f5f8;"><td style="width:45%;font-weight:bold;">Booking number</td><td>{!Booking__c.Name}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold;">Vehicle</td><td>{!Booking__c.Vehicle_Display__c}</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color:#f3f5f8;"><td style="font-weight:bold;">Pick-up</td><td>{!Booking__c.Start_DateTime__c}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold;">Return</td><td>{!Booking__c.End_DateTime__c}</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color:#f3f5f8;"><td style="font-weight:bold;">Pick-up branch</td><td>{!Booking__c.Branch_Address__c}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold;">Rental total</td><td>{!Booking__c.Total_Amount__c}</td></tr>
<tr style="background-color:#f3f5f8;"><td style="font-weight:bold;">Refundable security deposit</td><td>{!Booking__c.Deposit_Amount__c}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold;">Grand total paid</td><td><strong>{!Booking__c.Grand_Total__c}</strong></td></tr>
</table>
<p style="font-size:14px;margin:20px 0 8px 0;">Please bring your original driving licence and arrive a few minutes early so we can complete the pick-up inspection with you.</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Need to change or cancel? Open <strong>My Bookings</strong> on the Smart Car Rental portal or chat with our Rental Concierge.</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;margin:0;">Have a safe trip!<br/>The Smart Car Rental team</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background-color:#f3f5f8;color:#5c6670;font-size:12px;padding:14px 28px;">This is an automated message about your booking {!Booking__c.Name}.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>